					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13932623#post-4844697</guid>
				<title>Revisions.</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13932623/scp-5156#post-4844697</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 14 Dec 2020 17:07:27 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>TheAnimateFry</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5927653</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Even if I can't, I want to say a few things.</p> <p>First Problem: There is no formatting. If you want your SCP class object to be taken seriously, than at least add some formatting.</p> <p>Second Problem: I see a lot of SCP-096 in here. Some more editing to more distinguish this from 096 is necessary.</p> <p>Third Problem: The Exploration files need a lot of work, primarily focused on the usage of formatting and content.</p> <p>Fourth Problem: not structured that well. then again, Formatting.</p> <p>Look at <a href="http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/silberescher-4">How To Write An SCP</a>, it should help you get some of this together more.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
